  <p class="cs__p rv">
    Learning screens are dense, so the interface stays neutral: Inter, a cool grey scale and black
    primary buttons. Colour is kept for the AI. The robot mascot and the violet-to-pink “Ask
    anything” field show where the mentor is, on every screen.
  </p>
