<section class="cs__sec" aria-labelledby="s7">
  <p class="st-k rv">07 · Reflection</p>
  <h2 class="cs__h rv" id="s7">An AI mentor needs structure to feel human</h2>
  <p class="cs__p rv">
    An open chat box can do anything, which makes it hard to know what to do first. Most of the
    work went into giving the conversation shape, so the mentor leads at the right moments and the
    learner stays in control.
  </p>
  <div class="st-grid st-g2 st-wide">
    <div class="pcard rv">
      <p class="pcard__word">Learning</p>
      <h3 class="pcard__title">Quick replies over blank fields</h3>
      <p class="pcard__text">
        Answer chips, accept-or-decline buttons and suggested plans keep the chat moving and make
        every choice clear, while typing or talking is always available.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="pcard rv">
      <p class="pcard__word">Next</p>
      <h3 class="pcard__title">Built to grow</h3>
      <p class="pcard__text">
        The roadmap adds Spanish and Hindi, more courses, job placement partnerships and
        certifications. The language toggle, roadmap structure and progress model already leave
        room for them.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
